/-!
# B-line IL, `J` pre-table (B5-J), part 7: the parameter phase

`parP Z kA kC wA wC`: from the axis descriptor `[k, pre, post, s, t, p, α, d]` on `Z`, the
registers (`ParV`)

    1 p   2 d   3 pre   4 post   5 kF   6 λF   7 wd = wA·Q+wC   9 2^Q   10 2^(Q+1)
    11 kJ = kA·Q+kC   12 2^kJ   20 Q   21 R = p/7   22 s   23 t   24 λ   25 α   26 w = 7 kF

(`Q = segPF p d s`, `λ = lamP d`), every other stack unchanged (`Rn.parP`).
